<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:ital,wght@family=Georgia:ital,wght@family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Georgia, serif;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 2cm 1.5cm;
            max-width: 100%;
            color: #000;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            margin-top: 1.2em;
            margin-bottom: 0.6em;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 22px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .center {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .right {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .left {
            text-align: left;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0.8em 0;
            text-indent: 1.5em;
        }

        .no-indent {
            text-indent: 0;
        }

        .placeholder {
            border: 1px dashed #666;
            background-color: #f8f8f8;
            margin: 1em 0;
            padding: 10px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 1em 0;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 6px;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }

        ul, ol {
            margin-left: 2em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Document Title</h1>

<p class="no-indent">This is the first paragraph of the document. It is extracted verbatim and aligned with the original layout.</p>

<p>This second paragraph continues directly below the first with normal spacing and indentation.</p>

<p class="center">This line is centered as it appears in the source.</p>

<p class="right">This line is right-aligned.</p>

<p>This line has no special alignment and follows the standard left alignment of the document.</p>

<h2>Section Heading</h2>

<p>Content under this heading follows immediately below the previous section with appropriate vertical spacing.</p>

<div class="placeholder" style="width: 80%; height: 300px; margin: 1em auto;">
    [Chart: centered in the middle of the page]
</div>

<p>Text continues after the chart with normal flow.</p>

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Column 1 Header</th>
        <th>Column 2 Header</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Row 1, Cell 1 content</td>
        <td>Row 1, Cell 2 content</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Row 2, Cell 1 content</td>
        <td>Row 2, Cell 2 content</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<ul>
    <li>First item in the unordered list</li>
    <li>Second item in the unordered list</li>
    <li>Third item in the unordered list</li>
</ul>

<ol>
    <li>First item in the ordered list</li>
    <li>Second item in the ordered list</li>
    <li>Third item in the ordered list</li>
</ol>

<p><strong>Bold text</strong> and <em>italic text</em> are included exactly as they appear.</p>

<p>This is the end of the extracted document content with all visible text faithfully reproduced and layout preserved as closely as possible.</p>

</body>
</html>
